{"title":"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/a/edae70ddedf89e790936ed4035c5ca1480212e0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\phi(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" /> be the number of positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f116a921790b1fb2c3fa965d2cd9379c14241ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&lt; n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"45\" height=\"13\" /> which are relatively prime to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. For how many distinct values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/1/7914b57d649337f3380b2e1ad9054310b8eb160c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\phi(n)=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/4/9f48e5f5ac83d1607c9b94b0fc6b3c45868850dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 0 \\quad \\text{(B) } 1 \\quad \\text{(C) } 2 \\quad \\text{(D) } 3 \\quad \\text{(E) } 4 \\quad \\text{(F) } 5 \\quad \\text{(G) } 6 \\quad \\text{(H) } 7 \\quad \\text{(I) } 8 \\quad \\text{(J) } 9 \\quad \\text{(K) } 10 \\quad \\text{(L) } 11 \\quad \\text{(M) } 12\\quad \\text{(N) } 13\\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"799\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/a/31a52992460da82962d1a17adee8e584e4983e51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=p_1^{k_1}\\cdots p_s^{k_s}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e47920c86b20f89bc6e69be1be84ae0ec78c057.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\phi(n)=p_1^{k_1-1}\\cdots p_s^{k_s-1}\\cdot (p_1-1)\\cdots (p_s-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"334\" height=\"22\" />. Hence every prime factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is contained in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/1/8210bdf82570d84226d2dec154fc8fa31cff8f74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{2,3,5,7,13\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the\nlargest prime dividing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/c/50cfa951a1371ba291ab8092a82a8a3f1d577285.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8ec81fb1e8834889b104e93a9baf9a59ec9953.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=13,26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/9/5f95fee4e5abb16c2f5c07c41672e3a97c63d2de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/c/30c834dcde7fa1059437b547832112c5bef5f087.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=7k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/4/da46124b3fcf8682a5ba2e433179cb42c8b62c23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7\\not |k, \\phi(k)=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" /> giving solutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/c/53ce0d9762ac9390691be1d2f1e72d999b964b72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=21,28,42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"17\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/4/9744b986a275413b1d5e52af4ee4642253f606d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/a/5fae984ecf8af25be9e89e4c6b8dafc0bbe7d109.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=5k$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/8/a580a2dae0ddf5a91309d53f08b68c531daf9837.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\not |k,\\phi(k)=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" />,\nno solutions since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/7/2b7ab540afc32a08901f42c02dd6092729c2bd6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\phi(k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> is always even unless it is 1. Otherwise <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/5/695f9d95e1709968118dff74273b45d8a6f21fc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=2^a\\cdot 3^b$\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" /> where\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f0e9b41743e7fa2d4493b18643ef67485929c07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b\\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/5322a90d800f70056ce6608a387d8b9c2e4bf80c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\phi(n)=2^a\\cdot 3^{b-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" />. Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/7/d276648b47e5bc4f69521e80d95232317f56d940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2,b=2,n=36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore all solutions\nare given by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/4/034cab309ce69e4ab1c013fc11a7088617246658.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=13,26,21,28,42,36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"186\" height=\"17\" /> and the answer is G.\n</p><p>~Solution by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/user/209000%7C\">Alexheinis</a> but not posted on the wiki by Alexhienis\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest\" title=\"2007 iTest\">2007 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 iTest Answer Key\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"cen